(v) Copies of all forms IAP 66 or DS-2019 issued to the foreign medical graduate seeking the waiver;

(v) Copies of all forms IAP 66 or DS-2019 issued to the foreign medical graduate seeking the waiver;
(vi) A copy of the foreign medical graduate's curriculum vitae ;
